# Legacy artifact: dashboard.php / reconcile-sheet.php still write data.js
# on every save, but the client reads events.json directly. We keep the
# server-side regeneration for back-compat with anything still loading it
# but stop committing the regenerated copy into the repo (each save was
# producing a ~460 KB diff alongside the events.json change). Delete the
# regeneration code once you can confirm no consumers remain.
data.js

